2026-10-07 20:00:09.377 DEBUG icod.agent.runtime.loop: STEP 4: model responded ->\n  - text: ## Implementation Plan: Homepage with Sidebar and Header\n\n### Overview\nCreate a persistent layout for authenticated pages with a 20% width sidebar on the left containing navigation, and a header at the top with user controls. The main content area will display the welcome message.\n\n### Files to Create\n\n**1. `frontend/src/components/layout/Sidebar.jsx`**\n- Fixed-width sidebar (w-1/5 or 20% of viewport)\n- Background color: white with right border\n- Content:\n  - App title "Spreadsheet Demo" at top with padding\n  - Navigation buttons below with spacing:\n    - "Home" button (with home icon from lucide-react)\n    - "Workspaces" button (with briefcase icon)\n  - Active state highlighting for current route\n  - Buttons use `variant="ghost"` for subtle styling\n\n**2. `frontend/src/components/layout/Header.jsx`**\n- Horizontal bar spanning the right 80% of the page\n- Background: white with bottom border\n- Content (right-aligned):\n  - Bell icon (notification) with optional badge\n  - User profile dropdown menu with:\n    - User name and email\n    - "Logout" option\n  - Dropdown state managed with local useState\n\n**3. `frontend/src/components/layout/AppLayout.jsx`**\n- Flexbox layout wrapper combining Sidebar + Header + Main content\n- Structure:\n  ```\n  ┌─────────┬─────────────────────┐\n  │ Sidebar │ Header              │\n  │         ├─────────────────────┤\n  │         │                     │\n  │         │ Main Content        │\n  │         │ (Outlet)            │\n  └─────────┴─────────────────────┘\n  ```\n- Uses React Router's `<Outlet />` to render child routes\n\n### Files to Modify\n\n**4. `frontend/src/pages/Dashboard.jsx`**\n- Rename to `Home.jsx` (optional, or keep as Dashboard)\n- Remove logout button (now in header)\n- Simplify to show: "Hi {username}! Nice to meet you"\n- Keep user info display\n\n**5. `frontend/src/App.jsx`**\n- Wrap protected routes with `<AppLayout>`\n- Update route structure:\n  ```jsx\n  <Route path="/" element={<ProtectedRoute><AppLayout /></ProtectedRoute>}>\n    <Route index element={<Navigate to="/home" replace />} />\n    <Route path="home" element={<Dashboard />} />\n    <Route path="workspaces" element={<Workspaces />} /> {/* Future */}\n  </Route>\n  ```\n\n### Styling Approach\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes for layout\n- Sidebar: `w-1/5 h-screen fixed left-0 top-0`\n- Header: `h-16 fixed top-0 right-0` with `left-1/5` offset\n- Main content: `ml-[20%] pt-16` to account for sidebar and header\n- Icons: lucide-react (Home, Briefcase, Bell, User, LogOut)\n\n### Verification Steps\n1. Start dev server: `npm run dev`\n2. Navigate to `/home` after login\n3. Verify sidebar displays correctly with navigation buttons\n4. Verify header shows user profile menu and bell icon\n5. Verify main content shows welcome message with username\n6. Test logout functionality from profile dropdown\n7. Test navigation button hover states\n\nReady to implement when you approve!
