tive Tasks:** Implementing spreadsheet view components and integrating with backend APIs.</parameter>\n<parameter name="new_string">## Current Status\n**Current Phase:** Sprint 4 - Spreadsheet View\n**Active Tasks:** Testing and validating spreadsheet view functionality.</parameter>\n</invoke>\n</function_calls>\n\n<function_calls>\n<invoke name="todowrite">\n<parameter name="todos">[{"content": "Create spreadsheet directory structure and Spreadsheet.jsx (grid component)", "status": "completed", "priority": "high"}, {"content": "Create SheetHeader.jsx (sheet title bar)", "status": "completed", "priority": "high"}, {"content": "Create Toolbar.jsx (visual placeholder toolbar)", "status": "completed", "priority": "medium"}, {"content": "Create AddColumnDialog.jsx (modal for new column)", "status": "completed", "priority": "high"}, {"content": "Create SheetView.jsx (main page component)", "status": "completed", "priority": "high"}, {"content": "Update App.jsx — add sheet route", "status": "completed", "priority": "high"}, {"content": "Update Header.jsx — detect spreadsheet route", "status": "completed", "priority": "medium"}, {"content": "Update Sidebar.jsx — add collapsed prop", "status": "completed", "priority": "medium"}, {"content": "Update Workspaces.jsx — add navigation to sheets", "status": "completed", "priority": "medium"}, {"content": "Verify build compiles without errors", "status": "completed", "priority": "high"}]</parameter>\n</invoke>\n\nSpreadsheet View implementation is complete. All components are created, integrated, and the build compiles successfully. The next step is to test the functionality end-to-end and update Progress.md with Sprint 4 completion details.
